 READING: pc (path-cover polynomial) is the refined COMPOSITIONAL invariant -- it determines
 H(C3[.]) where scalar H does not; H = pc(.,1) is just its top coefficient. Resolves THM-1970's
 'more refined than H' + THM-1960's cyclic-H via the kernel K.
